This project uses open source dependencies. No Alfa-Bank source, brand assets, photographs, or official scoring rules are included. Independent demo UI, no affiliation implied.

Frontend direct dependencies:
React / React DOM (Meta): MIT
TypeScript (Microsoft): Apache-2.0
Vite, Vitest, Tailwind CSS, PostCSS, Autoprefixer: MIT
React Router, React Hook Form, Zod, @hookform/resolvers: MIT
Radix UI primitives, class-variance-authority, clsx, tailwind-merge, Sonner: MIT
Lucide: ISC
Testing Library: MIT; jsdom: MIT
UI wrappers follow the shadcn/ui composition pattern; shadcn/ui is MIT.

Backend:
Python: PSF-2.0
Django, Django REST Framework, drf-spectacular: BSD-3-Clause
psycopg / psycopg-binary: LGPL-3.0-or-later (binary distribution also bundles libpq and its dependencies)
Gunicorn: MIT
pytest, pytest-django: MIT
PostgreSQL: PostgreSQL License
Nginx: BSD-2-Clause
Node.js: MIT and included third-party licenses

Exact frontend dependency tree is recorded in frontend/package-lock.json; Python dependencies in backend/requirements.lock.txt. Full license texts and copyright notices remain in installed package distributions and container images; preserve them when redistributing. This notice summarizes direct dependencies and does not replace upstream licenses.
